:"ESPN"},{"headline":"ACC suspends Louisville LB Clark, UNC DB Smith over postgame brawl","description":"The ACC has suspended Louisville LB Stanquan Clark and North Carolina DB Greg Smith III, while also issuing fines and public reprimands to both schools in the wake of Saturday's postgame brawl.","published":"2026-11-16T16:19:01.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50502075/louisville-lb-clark-unc-db-smith-suspended-postgame-brawl","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Michigan top WR JJ Buchanan (shoulder) likely out for season","description":"Michigan's leading receiver JJ Buchanan will likely miss the rest of the season after he sustained a shoulder injury in Saturday's loss at No. 16 Oregon.","published":"2026-11-16T16:30:02.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50502065/michigan-top-wr-jj-buchanan-shoulder-likely-season","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2026 college football coaching carousel: Tracking every open job","description":"As the carousel spins, we'll keep you updated with all the comings and goings.","published":"2026-11-16T16:00:31.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50358611/2026-cfb-coaching-carousel-firings-hirings","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"UTEP fires head coach Scotty Walden following 8th straight loss","description":"The UTEP Miners, just 1-9 this season and mired in an eight-game losing streak, have fired head coach Scotty Walden, the school announced Monday.","published":"2026-11-16T15:13:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50501672/utep-1-9-season-fires-coach-walden-8th-straight-loss","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Where is 'College GameDay'? 2026 schedule, locations, recaps","description":"What is the \"College GameDay\" schedule? Find out more about where